## 🤝 Contributing

Contributions welcome!

1. Fork the repository
2. Clone your fork: `git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/ai-tidy-tabs.git`
3. Make changes in the appropriate module (see [Architecture](#architecture))
4. Test in Zen Browser (copy the folder to your Sine mods directory)
5. Submit a pull request

### Module responsibilities

| Module | Responsibility |
|--------|----------------|
| `config.mjs` | Constants only — no logic, no side effects |
| `tabs.mjs` | Reading tab data from gBrowser |
| `rules.mjs` | Domain→folder rule matching |
| `ai.mjs` | AI API communication |
| `groups.mjs` | Tab group creation and manipulation |
| `notify.mjs` | User notifications |
| `browser-ui.mjs` | DOM injection (buttons, commands) |
| `browser-hooks.mjs` | Context menu integration |
| `click-handler.mjs` | Pipeline orchestration |

